<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Our God shall come,</l><l>He shall come and shall not keep silence;</l><l>He shall call</l><l>To the heaven above and to the earth.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Gather my saints</l><l>Gather my saints together unto me.</l><l>And the heavens</l><l>Shall declare His righteousness. Selah.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
